# run_alp.mac — Macro for ALP decay photon injection runs
#
# Only performs /run/initialize. The /run/beamOn count is issued from
# damsa_alp_inject.cpp after initialization, computed as
#     beamOn = generator->GetNEvents() * gALPRefireFactor
# so every input row is fired exactly `refire_factor` times regardless of
# how many rows the CSV contains.
#
# Usage:
#   ./build/damsa_alp_inject output/alp_decay_photons_ma100MeV.csv run_alp.mac
#   ./build/damsa_alp_inject output/alp_decay_photons_ma100MeV.csv run_alp.mac 5

/run/initialize
